            <ArticleTitle>Taking the jab out of needles.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>37-40</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Typically, health professionals regard injections and venipuncture as routine for them and a minor nuisance for the patient. Yet for others, needles arouse dread and anxiety. This fear of needles may even lead some people to avoid dental and health care.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
